(Step-by-Step Logic:) Tj
50 613.0 Td
(  1. Represent each subset as a binary number \(mask\) from 0 to 2^n-1.) Tj
50 600.0 Td
(  2. Bit i of mask = 1 means package i is included.) Tj
50 587.0 Td
(  3. For each mask: compute total weight and total value of selected packages.) Tj
50 574.0 Td
(  4. Feasibility check: total weight <= payload limit W.) Tj
50 561.0 Td
(  5. If feasible and value > best seen so far: update best.) Tj
50 548.0 Td
(  6. After all 2^n subsets: return the best feasible subset.) Tj
50 535.0 Td
