(  WHY ADDING ONE PACKAGE CAUSES DRAMATIC GROWTH:) Tj
50 704.0 Td
(    Adding one package to a set of n packages doubles the solution space) Tj
50 691.0 Td
(    because every existing subset can now either include or exclude the) Tj
50 678.0 Td
(    new package. This is binary branching at every step, giving 2^n growth.) Tj
50 665.0 Td
(    For example: going from n=25 to n=26 adds 33 MILLION new candidates.) Tj
50 652.0 Td
(    This exponential growth is unavoidable for exhaustive enumeration.) Tj
50 639.0 Td
() Tj
50 626.0 Td
